      "raw": "<p>So previously I&#39;ve calculated how many possible configurations of Sentinels exist (see&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/statistics-with-a-vengeance-4672), and now I have a GSF it&#39;s time to do MORE STATS! :D</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">So, let&#39;s start with the heroes! There are 10C2 = 10 x 9 / 2 = 45 two-ship teams, 10C3 = 120 three-ship teams, 10C4 = 210 four-ship teams, 10C5 = 252 five-ship teams and 10C6 = 210 six-ship teams, so we have a grand total of&nbsp;<strong>837</strong>&nbsp;Strike Force permutations.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">With Volneth, we have twelve sectors, and thus 12C3 =&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">220</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;combinations of sectors. Finally, five opposition forces with two difficulties each give&nbsp;<strong>10&nbsp;</strong>villains total. So 837 x 220 x 10 =&nbsp;<strong>1,841,400&nbsp;</strong>possible games. That is a very large number!</span></p>",
